          , costTrapAvoided: "developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning: reasoning tokens bill as output tokens and can reach tens of thousands depending on effort. Each tier is a fixed, pre-declared (model,effort) pair; escalation swaps which tier runs next and never mutates an effort value, so this cost trap cannot be hit by construction."
          , cps: "EscalatingWorkflow.ffg keeps all routing in Grace; the host executes one of a closed six-member Action vocabulary chosen from a trusted validationKind (never model output) and injects the structured Result back via an explicit history list on re-invocation. Only the first tier choice is a model call; later escalation is mechanical."
